go 1.25.4

// Six of the repository's eight modules. provider/local/onnx and
// e2e/localinference are deliberately absent: they need CGO, a native ONNX
// Runtime, and a statically linked tokenizer, and adding them here would make
// `go build ./...` at the repository root fail for everyone who has not
// installed those. They are built and linted by the `onnx` CI job instead, and
// TestWorkspaceListsEveryNonCGOModule in architecture_test.go fails if this
// list drifts from that rule in either direction. See ARCHITECTURE.md.
use (
	.
	./harness
	./harness/codemode/gomonty
	./harness/sessionloop
	./tui
	./e2e
)

// harness/go.mod requires harness/sessionloop v0.1.0, a version that is not
// tagged yet (the tag lands when Wave B ships). The use directive above covers
// package resolution, but any full-module-graph load (forced by pre-1.17
// dependencies elsewhere in the workspace, e.g. gopkg.in/yaml.v2's go 1.15)
// still tries to fetch the tagged go.mod and fails with "unknown revision".
// This version-pinned replace keeps the whole workspace buildable until the
// tag exists, at which point it can be deleted.
replace github.com/regularkevvv/agentic/harness/sessionloop v0.1.0 => ./harness/sessionloop
